  "assumptions": [
    "Skill success probabilities and fight durations are forecast assumptions, not measured V4/V5 gameplay and not hidden reward rolls.",
    "Loot is fixed at cast start; a won fish challenge always lands its predetermined fish. No secondary random failure.",
    "Travel, return and cooldown are zero. Presentation seconds are an optional skippable scene transition, never a server reward gate.",
    "Free basic fishing stays available; paid bait is optional and one portion is spent per started cast. Paid supply must be replenishable without a six-hour stock wait.",
    "Prices and existing tackle class preferences are read from the live economy catalog. No sale, recipe, XP or gameplay changes are applied by this proposal.",
    "Future blueprint finding is disabled until storage, recipes and bounded passive effects exist; its former chance is weeds, never an unusable placeholder item.",
    "Stationary rates exclude human breaks, inventory limits, food production, orders/market proceeds and demand saturation. They do not establish a 24–25 day progression result.",
    "Tank holds2/3/4outing-fuel units; same120minute regeneration for every level. This limits sustainable trips, not the time of an ongoing mini-game.",
    "Crate holds3/5/8fish and allows10/14/20started casts per outing. Every outcome/cancel consumes a cast; weeds/finds/failures do not occupy fish slots. No free mid-outing unload.",
    "Tank capacity upgrades do not grant refill or faster regeneration. Settle regeneration under old capacity before changing it; no retroactive refill after capped offline time.",
    "Motor response and hull burst stability affect physical control. Added success-bps in this report are human-skill forecast hypotheses only, never hidden after-win reward RNG.",
    "Outing fuel is spent at first confirmed cast; finished, aborted and empty outings do not refund it. Preview/cancel before any cast is free.",
    "Fresh-full-tank session and long-run12trips/day are separate bounds; do not add the initial stock to every calendar day.",
    "Unlimited active-hour figures are retained solely as timing diagnostics. Finite outing and fuel-aware visit rewards are the economy-facing outputs."
  ],
